## Interface: 30300
## Version: 1.0.9

## Title: Dialogue UI
## Notes: Quest Dialogue UI for Sirus 3.3.5a (dialogue, quests, gossip)

## Author: Raenore, Peterodox
## SavedVariables: DialogueUI_DB, DialogueUI_Saves
## X-Sirus-Update: https://github.com/AmonRay/YUI-Dialogue-Sirus/tree/main
## X-Sirus-Category: 13
## X-Sirus-Changelog: https://github.com/AmonRay/YUI-Dialogue-Sirus/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md


## X-GameType: Wrath
# 1.0.9: settings - tab widths from real text metrics (+ deferred relayout), mouse wheel scrolling everywhere, description/preview above the window background, dropdown shows the current choice; quest rewards - sheen hidden after the animation (it stayed on top of the item icon), tooltip falls back to the game tooltip; key hints print the key name on 3.3.5a
# 1.0.8 rebuild: self-contained DUI_C_Timer (C_Timer2 is hidden by SecureCapsule), PLAYER_ENTERING_WORLD instead of LOADING_SCREEN_DISABLED; all textures PNG -> uncompressed TGA (3.3.5a cannot load PNG)
# 1.0.8 rebuild 2: XML OnEvent passes `event` explicitly (3.3.5a inline OnEvent is function(self, event, ...), so '...' dropped the event name and the dialog stayed deferred forever)
# 1.0.8 rebuild 3: safety net - the initial-loading guard can no longer swallow NPC interactions after login
# 1.0.8 rebuild 4: OnGamePad* scripts set via DUI_SetScriptSafe (not in 3.3.5a); MuteSoundFile/UnmuteSoundFile stubs
# 1.0.8 rebuild 5: textures -> BLP (uncompressed BGRA, like ElvUI-for-Sirus), 9-slice panel emulation, smooth camera (SaveView/SetView + absolute zoom), IsUnitModelReadyForUI and other missing API, 3.3.5a gossip icons
# 1.0.8 rebuild 6: "Hide UI" works on 3.3.5a - the game interface is hidden while a dialog is open (UIParent:Hide() + SetUIVisibility(false), like Alt+Z)
# 1.0.8 rebuild 7: textures are drawn on 3.3.5a - every BLP now carries a full mip chain (as the uncompressed BLPs of ElvUI-for-Sirus); the release workflow runs scripts/convert_textures_335.py and commits the rebuilt textures
# 1.0.8 rebuild 8: the camera no longer jerks when a dialog closes on 3.3.5a - the game UI comes back first and the camera starts moving back a few frames later (SetView no longer runs in the heavy UIParent:Show() frame); a dialog opened right after another keeps the camera in place
# 1.0.8 rebuild 9: window textures resolve on 3.3.5a - ThemeUtil searches every asset category for bare names (theme -> shared -> icons/keys/gameassets/book/shapes/decor/preview), Compat_335 replaces atlas/gradient/mask API, 9-slice panels are rebuilt from plain textures with SetTexCoord, NPCType-Direction -> Icons/AskDirection
# 1.0.8 rebuild 10: template/layout cleanup - shared paths resolve through ThemeUtil, scroll bars follow the current theme with ThemeChanged, portrait and quest header textures resolve at use time; cursor texture prefix fixed to Icons/AskDirection (0 broken paths in the static scan)
# 1.0.8 rebuild 11: required-item count column; moving camera restores distance without saved heading; widget compatibility methods are private to DialogueUI objects (in-client acceptance pending)
# 1.0.8 rebuild 12: quest text wraps at full width (paragraph height measured per layout, pooled fontstrings reset size); journal objective progress counts into scroll range; wide item/currency counts reserve name space and reset layout on reuse; item button background 9-sliced; Interface Options category "Dialogue UI"

